# One repository, two gits -- Windows and Linux -- with different core.autocrlf
# settings. That is why six result files showed as fully modified with nobody
# having touched them: one side normalises CRLF to LF on commit, the other does
# not, so each machine rewrites the other's whole file. Normalise text to LF in
# the repository and let each working tree keep whatever it likes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep text conversion away from these entirely. models/local_kb/dense.npy is
# the shipped embedding matrix, and a line-ending rewrite inside a float32
# array would corrupt the index silently -- no error, just wrong vectors, on
# the deployed Space rather than here. (Verified intact before adding this:
# the committed blob still loads as (114, 1024) float32, all finite.)
*.npy binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
